// Title: Tamper Windows Defender - PSClassic
// ID: ec19ebab-72dc-40e1-9728-4c0b805d722c
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-06-07
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Attempting to disable scheduled scanning and other parts of Windows Defender ATP or set default actions to allow.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((Data like "*_Set-MpPreference*") and (((Data like "*_HighThreatDefaultAction Allow*" or Data like "*_htdefac Allow*" or Data like "*_LowThreatDefaultAction Allow*" or Data like "*_ltdefac Allow*" or Data like "*_ModerateThreatDefaultAction Allow*" or Data like "*_mtdefac Allow*" or Data like "*_SevereThreatDefaultAction Allow*" or Data like "*_stdefac Allow*")) or ((Data like "*_-dbaf $true*" or Data like "*_-dbaf 1*" or Data like "*_-dbm $true*" or Data like "*_-dbm 1*" or Data like "*_-dips $true*" or Data like "*_-dips 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableArchiveScanning $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableArchiveScanning 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableBehaviorMonitoring $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableBehaviorMonitoring 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableBlockAtFirstSeen $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableBlockAtFirstSeen 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableCatchupFullScan $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableCatchupFullScan 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableCatchupQuickScan $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableCatchupQuickScan 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableIntrusionPreventionSystem $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableIntrusionPreventionSystem 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableIOAVProtection $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableIOAVProtection 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableRealtimeMonitoring $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableRealtimeMonitoring 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableRemovableDriveScanning $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableRemovableDriveScanning 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableScanningMappedNetworkDrivesForFullScan $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableScanningMappedNetworkDrivesForFullScan 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableScanningNetworkFiles $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableScanningNetworkFiles 1*" or Data like "*_-DisableScriptScanning $true*" or Data like "*_-DisableScriptScanning 1*" or Data like "*_-MAPSReporting $false*" or Data like "*_-MAPSReporting 0*" or Data like "*_-drdsc $true*" or Data like "*_-drdsc 1*" or Data like "*_-drtm $true*" or Data like "*_-drtm 1*" or Data like "*_-dscrptsc $true*" or Data like "*_-dscrptsc 1*" or Data like "*_-dsmndf $true*" or Data like "*_-dsmndf 1*" or Data like "*_-dsnf $true*" or Data like "*_-dsnf 1*" or Data like "*_-dss $true*" or Data like "*_-dss 1*"))))
